# Skill changes

- Apply `governance/17-skill-openspace-lifecycle.md`.
- Keep one focused task per skill and make the description discriminating.
- Preserve user authority and refer to governance instead of duplicating policy.
- Treat OpenSpace FIX, DERIVED and CAPTURED outputs as proposals requiring review.
- Validate frontmatter and remove unfinished placeholders before enabling a skill.
